      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Your deep connection to the black blood manifests through you. When you take this feat, select an aelkhazak ancestry feat that grants an innate occult spell. You gain a spell that it offers that you can then cast once per day as an innate occult 7th rank spell. If you also have the feat that you gained the spell from, the innate spell you cast can make use of the unique benefits that feat offers when you cast it at 7th rank.</span></p>"
